### Pruebas SOLO por el gateway. Cambia @gw a la URL publica para repetirlas en la nube.
@gw = http://localhost:5000
# @gw = https://gateway-api-s15.onrender.com

### 1. Login Gerente  [200]
# @name loginGerente
POST {{gw}}/gateway/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "correo": "gerente@gimnasio.com", "clave": "Clave123!" }

###
@tokenGerente = {{loginGerente.response.body.token}}

### 2. Login Recepcionista  [200]
# @name loginRecep
POST {{gw}}/gateway/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "correo": "recepcion@gimnasio.com", "clave": "Clave123!" }

###
@tokenRecep = {{loginRecep.response.body.token}}

### 3. Registro  [201]  (cambia el correo en cada ejecucion)
POST {{gw}}/gateway/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{ "correo": "nuevo1@gimnasio.com", "clave": "Clave123!" }

### 4. Planes (publico)  [200]
GET {{gw}}/gateway/planes

### 5. Plan por id  [200]
GET {{gw}}/gateway/planes/1

### 6. Plan inexistente  [404]
GET {{gw}}/gateway/planes/9999

### 7. Crear plan sin token  [401 - lo responde el gateway]
POST {{gw}}/gateway/planes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Plan Test", "precio": 99.90, "duracionMeses": 2, "activo": true }

### 8. Crear plan con Recepcionista  [403 - lo responde la API]
POST {{gw}}/gateway/planes
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecep}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Plan Test", "precio": 99.90, "duracionMeses": 2, "activo": true }

### 9. Crear plan con Gerente  [201]
POST {{gw}}/gateway/planes
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenGerente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Plan Test", "precio": 99.90, "duracionMeses": 2, "activo": true }

### 10. Actualizar plan (ajusta el id)  [204]
PUT {{gw}}/gateway/planes/6
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenGerente}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Plan Test", "precio": 109.90, "duracionMeses": 2, "activo": true }

### 11. Eliminar plan (ajusta el id)  [204]
DELETE {{gw}}/gateway/planes/6
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenGerente}}

### 12. Socios sin token  [401]
GET {{gw}}/gateway/socios

### 13. Socios con token  [200]
GET {{gw}}/gateway/socios
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecep}}

### 14. Instructores sin token  [401]
GET {{gw}}/gateway/instructores

### 15. Instructores con token  [200]
GET {{gw}}/gateway/instructores
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecep}}

### 16. Instructor por id  [200]
GET {{gw}}/gateway/instructores/2
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecep}}

### 17. Instructor inexistente  [404]
GET {{gw}}/gateway/instructores/99
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecep}}

### 18. Token alterado  [401]
GET {{gw}}/gateway/instructores
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecep}}x

### 19. Ruta inexistente en el gateway  [404]
GET {{gw}}/gateway/nada

### 20. 502 Bad Gateway: DETEN InstructoresApi y ejecuta  [502]
GET {{gw}}/gateway/instructores
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenRecep}}

### 21. Llamada DIRECTA al microservicio 2 sin token  [401]
GET http://localhost:5056/api/instructores
# Nube: GET https://instructores-api-s15.onrender.com/api/instructores
